---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import Section from "../../components/Section.astro";
import Stage from "../../components/Stage.astro";
---
<Base title="Progress: the native bar, on tokens" description="iVOLT progress: styled native <progress> with determinate and indeterminate states, sizes and status colours, respecting reduced motion.">
  <article class="docs-prose">
    <h1>Progress</h1>
    <p>The native <code>&lt;progress&gt;</code> element, styled. Give it a visible label with <code>&lt;label for&gt;</code> or an <code>aria-label</code>. Without <code>value</code> it is indeterminate and animates; under reduced motion the animation stops.</p>
    <p class="docs-meta"><strong>CSS:</strong> <code>css/components/progress.css</code> (in <code>ivolt.css</code>).</p>
    <Stage primary name="progress/basic" title="A determinate bar" />
    <Section title="Sizes" num={1}>
      <p>Three thicknesses and one public local. <code>iv-progress--sm</code> is 0.25rem, the default 0.5rem and <code>iv-progress--lg</code> 1rem with a full radius; all three only set <code>--iv-progress-size</code>, so any other thickness is one declaration on the element. Added in v0.6, together with the rename: <code>--iv-progress-size</code> replaces the <code>--iv-progress-height</code> of v0.1 to v0.5.</p>
      <Stage name="progress/sizes" title="Three sizes and a custom thickness" />
    </Section>

    <Section title="Modifiers and locals" num={2}>
      <p><code>--sm</code> and <code>--lg</code> for the thickness; <code>--success --warning --danger</code> for the bar colour. Public locals: <code>--iv-progress-size</code> (track thickness), <code>--iv-progress-color</code> (the bar), <code>--iv-progress-track</code> and <code>--iv-progress-track-subtle</code> (the groove behind it) and <code>--iv-progress-groove</code> (its inner shadow, drawn with <code>--iv-color-hover-surface</code>).</p>
    </Section>

    <Section title="Common mistakes" num={3}>
      <ul><li>A <code>div</code> with a background instead of the native element.</li><li>Progress without a label or without <code>max</code>.</li></ul>
    </Section>

    <Section title="Class index" num={4}>
      <p>Parts and modifiers of this family that the examples above do not show. The full list per stylesheet lives in the <a href="/reference">reference</a>.</p>
      <div class="docs-scroller docs-class-index">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Class</th><th>What it does</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><code>iv-progress--success</code></td><td>Success tone of the bar.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>iv-progress--warning</code></td><td>Warning tone.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>iv-progress--danger</code></td><td>Danger tone.</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </Section>
  </article>
</Base>
